==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Esperanto ''[[neni-]]'' (negative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix) + ''[[-am]]'' (correlative suffix of time).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/neˈniam/|lang=eo}}

===Correlative===
